1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,460
10 lakh ki salary par tax zero,

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,920
phir bhi Papa policy khareedwa rahe the.

3
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:08,084
Yeh kahani meri behen ki hai. Pehli badi naukri,

4
00:00:08,084 --> 00:00:11,950
pehli badi salary. Aur pehle hi hafte, HR ka email aaya.

5
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:14,410
Sawaal tha, purana regime chahiye ya naya?

6
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:18,193
Shaam ko dining table par yeh email poora ghar padh raha tha.

7
00:00:18,193 --> 00:00:20,715
Behen ne laptop khola, Mummy chai le aayi.

8
00:00:20,715 --> 00:00:24,183
Papa ne chashma lagaya aur seedha bole. Purana regime lo beta,

9
00:00:24,183 --> 00:00:27,020
hum hamesha usi mein rahe hain. Wahi safe hai.

10
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,816
Papa ki dalil simple thi.

11
00:00:28,816 --> 00:00:32,409
Purane regime mein tax bachane ke raaste hain. Policy lo,

12
00:00:32,409 --> 00:00:36,002
PPF kholo, FD lock karo, tax kam ho jaata hai.

13
00:00:36,002 --> 00:00:39,236
Unke liye tax bachana matlab kuch na kuch khareedna.

14
00:00:39,236 --> 00:00:42,110
Saalon se har March yahi hota aaya tha.

15
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:45,679
Bhai hoodie mein sofa par tha, phone haath mein. Bola, Papa,

16
00:00:45,679 --> 00:00:48,924
naya regime lo, internet pe sab yahi bol rahe hain.

17
00:00:48,924 --> 00:00:52,169
Papa ne poochha, kyun? Bhai ke paas jawab nahi tha.

18
00:00:52,169 --> 00:00:54,440
Bas subah dekhi ek reel yaad thi.

19
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,770
Aur yahin asli dikkat hai. Ek taraf aadat hai,

20
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:58,880
doosri taraf reel.

21
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:02,210
Beech mein woh insaan hai jiski salary kat-ti hai.

22
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:06,280
Usse koi hisaab karke nahi dikhata. Toh aaj hum hisaab karenge,

23
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:08,130
bilkul dining table wala, seedha.

24
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:09,855
Aaj ke sawaal yeh hain.

25
00:01:09,855 --> 00:01:12,270
Kya naya regime sabke liye sasta hai?

26
00:01:12,270 --> 00:01:16,065
Kya 80C ab bhi kaam ka hai, ya bas aadat hai?

27
00:01:16,065 --> 00:01:18,480
Aur HRA yaani kiraaye par tax chhoot,

28
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:20,550
kab sach mein kaam aati hai?

29
00:01:20,550 --> 00:01:22,620
Jawab isi ghar ki kahani se.

30
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:26,245
Pehle ek baat saaf kar dein. Regime yaani tax ka rulebook.

31
00:01:26,245 --> 00:01:29,211
Sarkar ne dono rulebook aapke saamne rakh diye hain.

32
00:01:29,211 --> 00:01:32,836
Purane mein rate zyada, par chhoot bahut. Naye mein rate kam,

33
00:01:32,836 --> 00:01:34,813
par chhoot gini-chuni. Kuch na bolo,

34
00:01:34,813 --> 00:01:36,790
toh naya apne aap lagta hai.

35
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:40,321
Raat ko maine behen ke saath uski salary slip kholi.

36
00:01:40,321 --> 00:01:44,205
Sabse upar gross salary, yaani katne se pehle ki poori kamai.

37
00:01:44,205 --> 00:01:46,323
Neeche PF aur ek line, TDS.

38
00:01:46,323 --> 00:01:50,560
TDS yaani company har mahine aapka tax pehle hi kaat leti hai.

39
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:54,909
Naye regime mein salaried logon ko seedha 75,000 ki chhoot milti hai.

40
00:01:54,909 --> 00:01:58,896
Isse standard deduction kehte hain. Koi policy nahi, koi receipt nahi,

41
00:01:58,896 --> 00:02:01,795
koi proof nahi. Bas aap naukri karte ho,

42
00:02:01,795 --> 00:02:03,970
aur itna hissa tax se bahar.

43
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:07,687
Matlab salary mein se pehle yeh hissa nikal jaata hai.

44
00:02:07,687 --> 00:02:10,661
Jo bachta hai, usse taxable income kehte hain.

45
00:02:10,661 --> 00:02:15,121
Taxable income yaani woh kamai jis par sach mein tax lagta hai.

46
00:02:15,121 --> 00:02:16,980
Ab asli twist aata hai.

47
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:21,485
Naye regime mein 12 lakh tak ki taxable income par tax zero hai.

48
00:02:21,485 --> 00:02:24,258
Yeh Section 87A ke rebate se hota hai.

49
00:02:24,258 --> 00:02:26,337
Rebate yaani tax banta toh hai,

50
00:02:26,337 --> 00:02:29,110
par sarkar use poora maaf kar deti hai.

51
00:02:29,110 --> 00:02:32,999
Behen ki taxable income is limit se kaafi neeche thi.

52
00:02:32,999 --> 00:02:36,887
Matlab naye regime mein uska income tax, zero. Na policy,

53
00:02:36,887 --> 00:02:39,220
na lock-in, na March ki bhaag-daud.

54
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:42,720
Papa ne chashma utaara aur phir se screen dekhi.

55
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:45,843
Salaried ke liye yeh faayda aur bada ho jaata hai.

56
00:02:45,843 --> 00:02:48,653
Pehle 75,000 ki chhoot, phir 12 lakh tak rebate.

57
00:02:48,653 --> 00:02:52,712
Dono milkar ek achhi khaasi salary ko tax se bahar rakh dete hain.

58
00:02:52,712 --> 00:02:55,210
Bahut log yeh jod kar dekhte hi nahi.

59
00:02:55,210 --> 00:02:58,206
Toh kya naya regime sabke liye sasta hai? Nahi,

60
00:02:58,206 --> 00:03:01,202
sabke liye nahi. Jinki salary is range mein hai,

61
00:03:01,202 --> 00:03:04,198
unke liye aksar haan. Par jinki kamai zyada hai,

62
00:03:04,198 --> 00:03:07,860
aur kharche chhoot wale hain, unki kahani alag ho sakti hai.

63
00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:09,667
Ek baat aur dhyaan rakhna.

64
00:03:09,667 --> 00:03:12,557
Yeh rebate salary jaisi normal income par hai.

65
00:03:12,557 --> 00:03:16,532
Share bechkar kamaya munafa, yaani capital gains, uske alag niyam hain.

66
00:03:16,532 --> 00:03:18,699
Agar aap trading bhi karte ho,

67
00:03:18,699 --> 00:03:21,590
poora hisaab kisi CA se zaroor karwa lena.

68
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:23,854
Ab Papa ka sawaal. Beta,

69
00:03:23,854 --> 00:03:28,836
toh meri LIC aur PPF sab bekaar? Yahan samajhna zaroori hai.

70
00:03:28,836 --> 00:03:32,007
80C yaani purane regime ka woh section,

71
00:03:32,007 --> 00:03:35,177
jahan kuch investments par chhoot milti hai.

72
00:03:35,177 --> 00:03:38,800
Naye regime mein yeh chhoot milti hi nahi.

73
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:43,115
Purane regime mein 80C ki limit 1.5 lakh hai. PPF, EPF,

74
00:03:43,115 --> 00:03:47,038
life insurance premium, tax saving fund, sab milakar itne tak.

75
00:03:47,038 --> 00:03:50,176
Yeh amount taxable income se ghat jaata hai.

76
00:03:50,176 --> 00:03:52,530
Sunne mein bahut bada lagta hai.

77
00:03:52,530 --> 00:03:55,032
Par ek cheez Papa ne kabhi nahi gini.

78
00:03:55,032 --> 00:03:58,160
Behen ki salary se EPF pehle hi kat raha hai.

79
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,411
EPF yaani provident fund,

80
00:03:59,411 --> 00:04:01,914
jo aap aur company har mahine daalte ho.

81
00:04:01,914 --> 00:04:03,790
Woh bhi 80C mein ginta hai.

82
00:04:03,790 --> 00:04:05,980
Limit ka hissa pehle se bhara hai.

83
00:04:05,980 --> 00:04:09,222
Ab socho behen ne Papa ki baat maan li.

84
00:04:09,222 --> 00:04:13,186
Purana regime liya, aur March mein ek insurance policy le li.

85
00:04:13,186 --> 00:04:16,788
Saalon tak premium bharna, lock-in, aur return ka pata nahi.

86
00:04:16,788 --> 00:04:18,950
Sirf isliye kyunki tax bachana tha.

87
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:22,238
Par naye regime mein uska tax pehle se zero tha.

88
00:04:22,238 --> 00:04:24,869
Jis tax ko bachane ke liye policy li,

89
00:04:24,869 --> 00:04:26,513
woh tax tha hi nahi.

90
00:04:26,513 --> 00:04:28,814
Policy ka faayda tax mein nahi mila.

91
00:04:28,814 --> 00:04:31,445
Bas paisa saalon ke liye bandh ho gaya.

92
00:04:31,445 --> 00:04:32,760
Yahi woh trap hai.

93
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:35,709
Iska matlab yeh nahi ki PPF bura hai.

94
00:04:35,709 --> 00:04:39,028
PPF par abhi lagbhag 7.1 percent saalana byaaj hai.

95
00:04:39,028 --> 00:04:42,346
Lambi bachat ke liye log ise pasand karte hain.

96
00:04:42,346 --> 00:04:44,927
Bas ab PPF bachat ke liye kholo,

97
00:04:44,927 --> 00:04:46,770
tax ke darr se nahi.

98
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:49,568
Toh 80C ab kaam ka hai ya nahi?

99
00:04:49,568 --> 00:04:52,716
Purane regime mein ho, toh haan, bahut kaam ka.

100
00:04:52,716 --> 00:04:56,213
Naye regime mein ho, toh tax ke liye bilkul nahi.

101
00:04:56,213 --> 00:05:00,060
Pehle regime chuno, phir socho ki 80C ki zaroorat hai bhi.

102
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:02,464
Papa ne thodi der chup rehkar kaha,

103
00:05:02,464 --> 00:05:05,898
matlab maine itne saal galat kiya? Maine kaha, nahi Papa.

104
00:05:05,898 --> 00:05:08,646
Aapke zamaane mein naya regime tha hi nahi.

105
00:05:08,646 --> 00:05:11,393
Tab wahi sahi tha. Bas rules badal gaye,

106
00:05:11,393 --> 00:05:13,110
aur hum aadat nahi badle.

107
00:05:13,110 --> 00:05:14,732
Ab kahani ka doosra pehlu.

108
00:05:14,732 --> 00:05:17,328
Har kisi ke liye naya regime nahi jeetta.

109
00:05:17,328 --> 00:05:19,275
Behen ki ek colleague ko dekho.

110
00:05:19,275 --> 00:05:21,871
Woh bade sheher mein kiraaye par rehti hai.

111
00:05:21,871 --> 00:05:25,440
Mummy-Papa ka health insurance bharti hai. Aur salary kaafi upar hai.

112
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:28,050
Pehle HRA samjho. HRA yaani House Rent Allowance,

113
00:05:28,050 --> 00:05:30,334
jo company kiraaye ke liye deti hai.

114
00:05:30,334 --> 00:05:34,249
Purane regime mein iska bada hissa tax se bahar ho sakta hai,

115
00:05:34,249 --> 00:05:36,533
agar aap sach mein kiraaya dete ho.

116
00:05:36,533 --> 00:05:38,490
Naye regime mein yeh chhoot nahi.

117
00:05:38,490 --> 00:05:41,782
Isliye rent receipt aur landlord ki details sambhaal kar rakho.

118
00:05:41,782 --> 00:05:44,415
Aur jo log apne ghar mein rehte hain,

119
00:05:44,415 --> 00:05:47,048
unke liye HRA chhoot ka sawaal hi nahi.

120
00:05:47,048 --> 00:05:50,340
Wahan HRA bas salary ka taxable hissa ban jaata hai.

121
00:05:50,340 --> 00:05:51,268
Ab home loan.

122
00:05:51,268 --> 00:05:55,597
Purane regime mein apne ghar ke loan ke byaaj par bhi chhoot milti hai.

123
00:05:55,597 --> 00:05:58,999
Byaaj yaani loan ka woh hissa jo bank ka munafa hai.

124
00:05:58,999 --> 00:06:02,710
Health insurance ka premium bhi purane regime mein income se ghatta hai.

125
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:07,033
Colleague ne sab joda. Kiraaye ki chhoot, 80C, health insurance.

126
00:06:07,033 --> 00:06:12,220
Deductions yaani woh kharche jo taxable income se ghata diye jaate hain.

127
00:06:12,220 --> 00:06:16,111
Uski deductions bahut badi ban gayi. Jitni badi deductions,

128
00:06:16,111 --> 00:06:17,840
utna purana regime aakarshak.

129
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:22,884
Uski salary itni upar hai ki naye regime mein unche slab tak jaati hai.

130
00:06:22,884 --> 00:06:26,486
Slab yaani income ke tukde, har tukde par alag rate.

131
00:06:26,486 --> 00:06:29,729
Naye regime ka sabse ooncha slab 30 percent hai,

132
00:06:29,729 --> 00:06:31,170
24 lakh ke upar.

133
00:06:31,170 --> 00:06:34,493
Aisi kamai par zero tax wala rebate kaam nahi aata.

134
00:06:34,493 --> 00:06:37,483
Ab har rupaye ki chhoot asli paisa bachati hai.

135
00:06:37,483 --> 00:06:41,470
Isliye purane regime ki badi deductions sach mein farq daal sakti hain.

136
00:06:41,470 --> 00:06:44,460
Uske case mein purana regime jeet bhi sakta hai.

137
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:47,576
Toh formula simple hai. Dono regime mein tax nikaalo,

138
00:06:47,576 --> 00:06:49,306
jo kam aaye, woh chuno.

139
00:06:49,306 --> 00:06:51,730
Income tax ki website par calculator hai.

140
00:06:51,730 --> 00:06:55,538
Wahan dono hisaab saath mein dikh jaate hain. Andaaza mat lagao,

141
00:06:55,538 --> 00:06:56,230
number dekho.

142
00:06:56,230 --> 00:06:59,018
Ab woh galti jo sabse zyada log karte hain.

143
00:06:59,018 --> 00:07:01,806
Regime ko aadat se chunte hain, hisaab se nahi.

144
00:07:01,806 --> 00:07:04,594
Kuch Papa ki tarah purane se chipke rehte hain.

145
00:07:04,594 --> 00:07:07,691
Kuch Bhai ki tarah reel dekhkar naya le lete hain.

146
00:07:07,691 --> 00:07:09,240
Dono mein hisaab gayab hai.

147
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:12,215
Doosri galti, March ki bhaag-daud. Saal bhar kuch nahi,

148
00:07:12,215 --> 00:07:14,528
aur aakhri hafte mein koi bhi policy.

149
00:07:14,528 --> 00:07:16,181
Sirf tax bachane ke liye.

150
00:07:16,181 --> 00:07:19,816
Product ko uske kaam ke liye lo, tax ke liye nahi.

151
00:07:19,816 --> 00:07:22,130
Chhoot bonus ho sakti hai, wajah nahi.

152
00:07:22,130 --> 00:07:23,821
Ab switch kaise karte hain.

153
00:07:23,821 --> 00:07:27,880
Salaried ko saal ki shuruaat mein HR ko regime batana hota hai.

154
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:30,586
Usi hisaab se har mahine TDS katta hai.

155
00:07:30,586 --> 00:07:34,307
Aap kuch nahi batate, toh company naya regime maan leti hai,

156
00:07:34,307 --> 00:07:35,660
kyunki wahi default hai.

157
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:37,003
Achhi khabar yeh hai.

158
00:07:37,003 --> 00:07:40,695
Salaried log return file karte waqt bhi regime badal sakte hain.

159
00:07:40,695 --> 00:07:41,702
Return yaani ITR,

160
00:07:41,702 --> 00:07:45,059
saal ke end mein sarkar ko diya gaya poora hisaab.

161
00:07:45,059 --> 00:07:46,738
HR ko galat bata diya,

162
00:07:46,738 --> 00:07:50,430
toh bhi faisla return mein ho sakta hai, deadline ke andar.

163
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:52,984
Bas yeh dhyaan rakhna. Jinki business income hai,

164
00:07:52,984 --> 00:07:54,899
unke liye switch itna aasaan nahi.

165
00:07:54,899 --> 00:07:57,772
Unke liye wapas aane ke mauke bahut kam hain.

166
00:07:57,772 --> 00:07:59,687
Agar aapki dukaan ya practice hai,

167
00:07:59,687 --> 00:08:02,560
regime badalne se pehle kisi jaankar se zaroor poochho.

168
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:06,055
Behen ne us raat HR ko reply kiya, naya regime.

169
00:08:06,055 --> 00:08:08,152
Papa ne hisaab dekhkar haan kahi.

170
00:08:08,152 --> 00:08:10,948
Policy ka form waapas drawer mein chala gaya.

171
00:08:10,948 --> 00:08:13,744
PPF ab bhi khulegi, par bachat ke liye.

172
00:08:13,744 --> 00:08:16,890
Yeh investment advice nahi hai. Apna hisaab khud karo.

173
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:20,681
Toh aapka sawaal. Aap abhi kaun se regime mein ho,

174
00:08:20,681 --> 00:08:24,472
purana ya naya? Comments mein bas purana ya naya likho.

175
00:08:24,472 --> 00:08:28,264
Aur agar pata hi nahi, toh apni salary slip dekho.

176
00:08:28,264 --> 00:08:29,780
Wahi pehla kadam hai.

177
00:08:29,780 --> 00:08:34,105
Agli baar woh sawaal jo har ghar mein hota hai.

178
00:08:34,105 --> 00:08:38,430
Share bechne par tax kab lagta hai, aur kab nahi?

179
00:08:38,430 --> 00:08:43,188
Capital gains ki poori kahani, isi dining table par. Tab tak,

180
00:08:43,188 --> 00:08:45,350
apna hisaab khud karna seekho.
